4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-03-26T11:42:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T19:35:21Z","closed_at":"2025-07-03T19:35:20Z","assignee":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Not reproducible with 4.3\n- Reproducible with 4.4 and 4.4.1-rc2\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.rc2 - Windows 11 Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis issue has started to occur for me since 4.4 (and 4.4.1-rc2)\n\nWhen starting a Web Export that has a AudioStreamPlayer, that autoplays an AudioStreamInteractive/AudioStreamPlaylist/AudioStreamSynchronized crashes with\n\nFirefox:\n```\nRuntimeError: indirect call to null\n    _main http://localhost:8060/tmp_js_export.js:9\n    callMain http://localhost:8060/tmp_js_export.js:9\n    Engine http://localhost:8060/tmp_js_export.js:801\n    Engine http://localhost:8060/tmp_js_export.js:796\n```\n\nChrome:\n```\nRuntimeError: null function or function signature mismatch\n    at 0ba71d56:0x3796e5\n    at 0ba71d56:0x6aabe1\n    at 0ba71d56:0x269eb41\n    at 0ba71d56:0x4ea02\n    at 0ba71d56:0x12a8c97\n    at 0ba71d56:0x12a9078\n    at 0ba71d56:0x12a9078\n    at 0ba71d56:0x5aaf91\n    at 0ba71d56:0x28fdb70\n    at 0ba71d56:0xfd39fc\n```\n\nIt's not a problem to have it not autoplay and do `.play()` at a later stage.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a project with an AudioStreamPlayer\n2. Set the stream to be a AudioStreamInteractive/AudioStreamPlaylist/AudioStreamSynchronized \n3. Enable Autoplay\n4. Run the project in a Browser\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[autoplay-audio-stream-null-function.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19466006/autoplay-audio-stream-null-function.zip)\n\nExtract the project and run it in a browser.","closed_by":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104645/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104645/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}